Official component guide: https://nikala.dev/docs/components/bubble. Component source: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/nikala-ui/ui/ce75abc6a948d2d78b2b22d368c2997832d0909b/packages/core/src/registry/components/ui/bubble.tsx.

