Button accepts standard Solid button attributes, variant and size, and loading:boolean. Loading disables the button and shows its Spinner. The documented default uses the original primary yellow theme.

Documented SolidJS example:
```tsx
import { Button } from "@/components/ui/button";

export default function Example() {
return (<Button>Button</Button>);
}
```

Source revision: ce75abc6a948d2d78b2b22d368c2997832d0909b. Preserve the source component classes and its matching theme/animation CSS. Preview compilation uses SolidJS 1.9.17 and babel-preset-solid 1.9.16. This is browser UI. Native Tauri v2 window, dialog and updater APIs require a desktop host and are not emulated in a browser preview.

The documented example additionally imports `lucide-solid`; these are demo requirements, separate from the component dependency graph.

